  "title": "Home-Cured Pancetta",
  "description": "Did you know you can make your own pancetta? All you need is pork belly, spices, and some patience as the meat needs to cure for 2 weeks in the fridge.",
  "authors": [
    "brandon"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:27:36-04:00",
